From 805771e186e21ba67edbe88f7c12fb26cb331332 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:09:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] SettingsIntelligence: Use the RavenOS glass theme on the
 search page

Match the RavenOS glass Settings theme:

- Always use a dark base theme, with every color read from
  res/values/raven_glass.xml (the same tokens as Settings) so a product
  overlay can recolor it.
- Draw the window on raven_backdrop with transparent system bars.
- Turn the search bar into a glass pill and show the results in one
  rounded glass card, centred in the same column as the Settings cards.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I0950d6a037094699fae04513f8409e6e00697046
---
